{"unit_id":"ltmroberthk915__dsh-computer-use#feature-1","repo":"ltmroberthk915/dsh-computer-use","commit":"11037e1a303d6dd3916feca1902a52198cec648a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Codex-style Computer Use 的功能「观察屏幕」：获取当前窗口状态、截图和可访问性控件树，也能查询控件文字与位置。agent 可先据此定位要操作的目标。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:299-361","lib/tools.js:387-427"]}
